@startuml k9x-stricter-over-time

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica Neue"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam padding 10
skinparam dpi 150

skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 12
  BorderThickness 1
}

skinparam arrow {
  Color #64748B
  FontColor #475569
  FontSize 11
  Thickness 2
}

title <size:20><b>The Rules Get Stricter Over Time</b></size>

rectangle "<b>1. K9X Sentinel</b>\n\nFinds a threat the framework\ndoes not fully cover\n\n<i>ThreatLabz 2026: a chatbot invents a debt</i>\n<i>and hands over a payment link</i>" as S #FEF3C7

rectangle "<b>2. Human review</b>\n\nK9X HIL\nApprove · reject" as H #FFEDD5

rectangle "<b>3. K9-AIF Framework</b>\n\nNew or stronger control,\nlisted in the capability catalog\n\n<i>k9-aif 1.14: OutboundLinkCheck</i>" as F #EFF6FF

rectangle "<b>4. K9X Inspector</b>\n\nA rule checks that solutions use it\n\n<i>egress rule: run OutboundLinkCheck</i>" as I #E0F2FE

rectangle "<b>5. Every K9-AIF solution</b>\n\nThe bar goes up; the report shows\nwhere each solution now falls short" as SOL #DCFCE7

S -right-> H
H -right-> F
F -down-> I
I -left-> SOL
SOL .up.> S : <i>the next threat</i>

@enduml
